<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="treatise-header">
  <div class="treatise-num">Volume II &middot; Technical Dispatches</div>
  <h1 class="treatise-title">Field Notes &amp; Engineering Treatises</h1>
  <div class="treatise-meta">
    Essays, mathematical models, firmware calibrations, and fabrication reflections from the machine shop and arena pits.
  </div>
</section>

<p class="lead drop-cap">
  Engineering documentation should not be confined to bullet points on a resume. The following treatises document practical engineering investigations: solving motor cogging on high-inertia kinetic bars, deriving kinematics for microspine surface anchoring, mass elimination strategies at VEX Worlds, and the metallurgy of surviving 12,000-Newton impact shockwaves.
</p>

<section class="blog-catalog" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
  <% posts.forEach((post, index) => { %>
    <article class="treatise-section" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;">
      <div class="treatise-header" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <div class="treatise-num"><%= post.chapter || ('Treatise ' + (index + 1)) %> &middot; <%= post.date %> &middot; <%= post.readingTime %></div>
        <h2 style="margin: 0.35rem 0 0.5rem 0; font-size: 1.55rem; border: none; padding: 0;">
          <a href="/blog/<%= post.slug %>" style="color: var(--ink-primary); text-decoration: none;">
            <%= post.title %>
          </a>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--ink-body);">
        <%= post.summary %>
      </p>

      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
        <div style="font-size: 0.82rem; font-variant-caps: all-small-caps; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--ink-tertiary);">
          <% if (post.tags && post.tags.length) { %>
            Tags: <%= post.tags.join(' &middot; ') %>
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a href="/blog/<%= post.slug %>" class="btn-book" style="padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.8rem;">
            Read Treatise &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  <% }) %>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
